	(text "FIXES vs original: (1) ESP32 5Vin now +5V from buck module (was raw battery); (2) STBY per group via SW1..SW3 (was always on); (3) ESP32 pin 21 (CMD) no longer tied to GND; (4) VM bulk caps, expansion header J3 + ESP32 GPIO break-out headers J4/J5 for a top PCB, mounting holes, screw terminals added."
